Software Requirement Specification (SRS)
Smart Event & Concert Ticket Booking System

1. Introduction:
1.1 Purpose
This Software Requirements Specification (SRS) document details the functional, non-functional, and interface requirements for the Smart Event & Concert Ticket Booking System. The intended audience includes software developers, quality assurance testers, project managers, and lab evaluators. It serves as a formal contract defining system expectations prior to development.
1.2 Scope
The Smart Event & Concert Ticket Booking System is a web-based platform that enables users to browse live events, select interactive venue seats, purchase digital tickets, and receive QR-code entry passes.
Included Features: User registration/login, event search and genre filtering, interactive seat grid selection, promo code application, third-party payment gateway integration, automated QR-code ticket generation, and an event organizer dashboard.
Excluded Features: Physical ticket printing/mailing services, on-site security gate hardware manufacturing, and direct bank-level ledger auditing.
