2. Overall Description:
2.1 Product Perspective
The application operates as a distributed client-server web app. The frontend communicates with a backend RESTful service, which interacts with a relational database, third-party payment processing services, and email notification gateways.
2.2 Product Functions
Account management and profile authentication.
Event discovery with search and category filtering (Concerts, Sports, Theater).
Real-time seat selection map with availability status.
Checkout and payment gateway transaction handling.
Automated PDF ticket generation with embedded QR codes.
Organizer management portal to post events and view ticket sales analytics.
